6	/**
7	 * Scheduled automatic restarts (Settings tab). Thin client over the CRUD actions
8	 * in lib/actions-game-control.ts — the worker sweep fires each due schedule
9	 * (optionally warning players over RCON first). All times are UTC.
10	 */
